es.\n-Now with 10 levels of undo for joints and figure poses.\n\nTested with iOS 8+\niPhone 6s, iPhone 8, iPhone Xs and iPad Pro\nand above. iOS 12 recommended", "languageCodesISO2A": ["EN"], "fileSizeBytes": "234628096", "formattedPrice": "￦4,400", "trackContentRating": "12+", "minimumOsVersion": "11.0", "averageUserRatingForCurrentVersion": 5, "sellerUrl": "https://www.facebook.com/pages/ArtPose/271644376354237", "bundleId": "com.artware.ArtM", "trackCensoredName": "ArtPose", "trackViewUrl": "https://apps.apple.com/kr/app/artpose/id836464625?uo=4", "averageUserRating": 5, "contentAdvisoryRating": "12+", "releaseDate": "2014-05-07T22:50:28Z", "userRatingCount": 2}]}